<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2657"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->loool<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, December 24, 2004 - 1:05 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I think some arrests should be made, reguarding to the posts from BTK. That would stop the fakes. Let the police come and confiscate your computer, and see how fast someone does it again...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
