<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2664"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Zenith<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, December 24, 2004 - 4:51 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->loool: It&#39;s not illegal to be a dope, most of us would be in jail. Point is though, how do you know those posts &#39;From BTK&#39; are fake? You don&#39;t really know one way or the other.  <BR> <BR>Hmmm &amp; Jed: I think we should assume BTK is bright enough not to allow himself to be caught by IP tracking, but in case he&#39;s not, let&#39;s be sure and give him a few more tips on line to help him not make any mistakes. Jeeez..... <!--/Text--></td></tr>
