<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2671"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Amatuerpi<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Amatuerpi<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, December 24, 2004 - 8:25 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Zenith..  My post was in response to a poster named B.T.K. in the &#34;From BTK&#34; thread.  His post to Tom was &#34;Still do not believe who I am?  Ask about the water left on at the Bright scene&#34;.  I was just pointing out that he is obviously a fake because there was not any water left on at the Bright murder scene.  I am sure everyone already knew his post was a fake but I was irritated by this &#34;imposter&#34; and wanted to call his bluff.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
