<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2679"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Jed Harris<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, December 24, 2004 - 10:48 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Zenith: It&#39;s hardly giving him tips. He&#39;s already posted, the logs may exists, and he can&#39;t change them. If the true posters are some poser getting kicks then that person would be traceable. If it is him, he would most likley be mobile, and I&#39;m just stating that it&#39;s traceable also. If BTK truly reads these threads then every single post is a tip, and he&#39;s toying with all of us... jeeez<!--/Text--></td></tr>
