<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2682"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Zenith<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, December 24, 2004 - 11:53 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Uh-oh, there you go again, giving out tips to the posters that non-techies may not know. Probably doesn&#39;t matter anywhoooo. I was just thinking the less he or imposter losers know about how everything works, all the better. Too late now.  <BR> <BR>But it&#39;s only my humble opinion, you&#39;re cool, no sweat. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
