</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tom_voigt<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, December 25, 2004 - 1:49 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text--><i>&#34;I truly think the reason there are none of those posts here is because we have moderators who don&#39;t put up with juvenile gags.&#34;</i> <BR> <BR>More like they have juvenile moderators who make me gag. Example? They allow negative remarks about me personally, but won&#39;t give me an account so I can defend myself. <BR> <BR>Enough about that. Who else has feedback about the messages from catchBTK.com? <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
