<!--Post: 2721--><!--Time: 1104026041-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2721"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Flytodeb<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Flytodeb<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, December 25, 2004 - 5:54 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->There were two people posting as &#34;BTK&#34; who said they walked down Arrowhead Street. Everyone studying this case knows that Vickie Wegerle&#39;s car was stolen, so he didn&#39;t walk away. Those two people cannot be BTK because they don&#39;t even have their facts straight. <BR>-Deb<!--/Text--></td></tr>
