<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2729"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Cyndi<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Cyndi<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, December 25, 2004 - 7:19 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom, it sounds to me like ghostie has a serious case of message board/chatroom envy.  You should be flattered they pay so much attention to your site and you personally.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
