<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2741"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->VSCANTU<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, December 25, 2004 - 10:05 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Good enough, &#34;Q&#34;. It just didn&#39;t make sense &#40;not that ANY of his stuff made sense&#41; to me.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 2741-->
<!--Post: 2746--><!--Time: 1104045747-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2746"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Sandy<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Sandy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, December 25, 2004 - 11:22 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Maybe he thought by taking her car away,anyone stopping by to visit her, would think she was not home because her car was gone.That would give him a lot more time to do his thing!!!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 2746-->
<!--Post: 2758--><!--Time: 1104081789-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2758"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Glad<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Glad<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, December 26, 2004 - 9:23 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Just a little feedback.  I am not surprised that the first investigation did not mention faucet left turned on.  The police often leave out little incidentals from public disclosures that only the killer would know.  The fact that BTK mentions this, is a hint that he is who he says he is, since the police would know this but not hte general public.  Also when he says he went back and danced down the Arrowhead Street { I think he said} that is not unusual either since many perpertrators go back to the scene of the crime to gloat over their &#34;work&#34; or get inside the investigation to see what the police know.  I would say the more intelligent the criminal is the more apt he is to revist crime scenes, toy with police and play the game catch me if you can.  I do believe that he is shrewd, intelligent and plans out every detail of his killings and his communication.  I also believe that while he would shy away from crowds and being a public figure he craves the attention of the masses, he is lonely, has no real friends, and is desperate to be admired, noticed and relevant.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 2758-->
<!--Post: 2763--><!--Time: 1104084817-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2763"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Nugzter<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, December 26, 2004 - 10:13 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Glad I agree with you about him returning to the scene, but how? I would like to know from someone who lived in the city back in the 70-80&#39;s if the WPD had their own crime scene photographer or was it the guy who also took the pics at K-Mart but did crime scenes to ean extra cash. &#40;In the case of BTK&#41; to revisit the scene without raising suspision. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 2763-->
<!--Post: 2781--><!--Time: 1104112938-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2781"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, December 26, 2004 - 6:02 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hi Nugzter <BR> <BR>I would like to read the poem, please post it.  <BR> <BR>skov<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 2781-->
<!--Post: 2785--><!--Time: 1104121451-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2785"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Glad<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Glad<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, December 26, 2004 - 8:24 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hi Nugzter, <BR> <BR> <BR>I do think he came back to crime scenes when there were crowds there.  I don&#39;t live there and am not sure how that played out, but it would be easy for an average person who lived in the area to come out when others are out looking.  Years ago police did not realize this.  Alot of this has come out with arsonist who often return to the scene sometimes even videotaping their fires.  Yes I would like to see the poem.  Let me tell you something from a personal knowledge unrelated but relevant.  I know a child molestor who moved into the house with children and teens, befriended the parents and then later the cops by getting a city job.  For years this man molested children but had the cops in his pocket.  They had no clue what he was up to until years later.  While some believed the child who came forward others did not.  I know from first hand experience what he was capable of.  The point is that he was friends with the parents, friends with the police and city officials.  I think the police need to revisit who was close to the families and to them, the police, before and after the crimes.  Also I wanted to say that I have thought for years that the Zodiac moved around the country and continued his crimes, it is possible he is one and the same as BTK. Just my opinion.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
