<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2841"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->littleme<!--/name--></b></a><br><!--field:posts--><!--/field--><!--field:registered--><!--/field--><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, December 27, 2004 - 12:10 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hey Skov, <BR>That is very interesting about the camera! Someone needs to be checking into that. But, do you know what the rest of the message means? The actual message part: CVNCTAHAWYDAEAFNRLLBQDHIIHLM24BTS9NK24VPOIXYFWDMLZ PCCLZFVYHAKMSTP <BR>What is all of this? <BR>Thanks for helping! <!--/Text--></td></tr>
