<!--Post: 2875--><!--Time: 1104216023-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2875"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Juno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Juno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, December 27, 2004 - 10:40 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->He may not have sent all of the photos either.  I mean, if you&#39;re gonna do something like that you may as well burn through a whole roll of film. <BR> <BR>Just because the ones he sent appeared to be in sequence does not mean some were not missing from the beginning, middle or end.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
